1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,119
Quick recap.

2
00:00:01,119 --> 00:00:07,330
Apis cerana is Nepal's hive bee, and the bee space makes the movable frame hive work.

3
00:00:07,330 --> 00:00:10,963
Silkworms pass five instars and four moults.

4
00:00:10,963 --> 00:00:15,143
Composite fish culture puts six carps in six niches.

5
00:00:15,143 --> 00:00:17,513
The buffalo gives most of our milk.

6
00:00:17,513 --> 00:00:25,989
Koch's postulates prove a microbe causes a disease, and the Ziehl Neelsen stain shows tuberculosis as red rods.

7
00:00:25,989 --> 00:00:34,778
Vaccines give active immunity, antibiotics act only on bacteria, and microbes also make our curd and our biogas.

